  "rationale": [
    "The affected open PRs represent different states and responsibility layers and must not be flattened into one replacement implementation.",
    "Development execution discipline is cross-cutting and must apply both to CFA3 development and CFA3 AI/agent behavior.",
    "Task/orchestration, security/effect authorization, model policy, and projection/UX layers retain their existing authorities.",
    "Cross-layer contradiction, unknown authority, stale state, or unresolved overlap fails closed.",
    "Owner overrides are explicit, scoped, conversation-bounded exceptions and never become global defaults."
